that stuff away.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.580
All it does, is it wraps a lot

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:42.270
of the open source regular
frameworks that you use

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:45.540
and creates an orchestration
layer around all of it

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:49.410
so that we have better
performance and better stability

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.660
and also great scalability.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:56.070
So, being able to increase
to many, many CPUs, GPUs,

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:57.270
all that kind of stuff.

